{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570162661,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a23c4ffeXM7ei3r7kNeMRl","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4b78dfb001qFSnMirynd7PTV","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a23c4ffeXM7ei3r7kNeMRl","messageID":"msg_1d4b77c5b001JscNYlBDwmE2xy","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b4f9fd8d57b4330","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"scorer-attach|^## 8|^### 8|^## 3|^### 3\\.1","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report-pass-1.md"},"output":"Found 9 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report-pass-1.md:\n  Line 21: - **Convergence:** the loop has **not converged**. Three of the four lineages (render-hooks-plugin, accuracy-runner and doctor-install) stopped at their five-iteration cap with a last novelty ratio above the 0.10 threshold (0.15, 0.11 and 0.125). Only scorer-attach reached 0.00. A second review pass after remediation is required before the loop counts as converged.\n\n  Line 145: ## 3. Active Finding Registry\n\n  Line 147: ### 3.1 Full table (43 merged findings plus 3 queued items)\n\n  Line 385: | `skill_agent` | pass | The scorer-attach lineage matched 36 doctor bridge owners to their router tags with no mismatch. Not re-run here. |\n\n  Line 394: ## 8. Deferred Items\n\n  Line 397: - **`run` commands that write.** `/doctor:deep-loop` and `/doctor:speckit` are `run` with class `add-only` (`command-attach.ts:80`, `:105`), so they start without asking and add files. The scorer-attach lineage summary said no `run` row writes. Whether `add-only` under `run` is intended belongs in a decision, not a fix.\n\n  Line 418: | scorer-attach | 6 | 5 | 0 | 14 | 14 |\n\n  Line 435: | scorer-attach | 5 | converged | 1.00, 0.33, 0.40, 0.29, 0.00 | below |\n\n  Line 444: - scorer-attach, render-hooks-plugin and accuracy-runner: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability, then one pass over all four.\n","title":"grep","metadata":{"metadata":{"matches":9,"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found 9 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report-pass-1.md:\n  Line 21: - **Convergence:** the loop has **not converged**. Three of the four lineages (render-hooks-plugin, accuracy-runner and doctor-install) stopped at their five-iteration cap with a last novelty ratio above the 0.10 threshold (0.15, 0.11 and 0.125). Only scorer-attach reached 0.00. A second review pass after remediation is required before the loop counts as converged.\n\n  Line 145: ## 3. Active Finding Registry\n\n  Line 147: ### 3.1 Full table (43 merged findings plus 3 queued items)\n\n  Line 385: | `skill_agent` | pass | The scorer-attach lineage matched 36 doctor bridge owners to their router tags with no mismatch. Not re-run here. |\n\n  Line 394: ## 8. Deferred Items\n\n  Line 397: - **`run` commands that write.** `/doctor:deep-loop` and `/doctor:speckit` are `run` with class `add-only` (`command-attach.ts:80`, `:105`), so they start without asking and add files. The scorer-attach lineage summary said no `run` row writes. Whether `add-only` under `run` is intended belongs in a decision, not a fix.\n\n  Line 418: | scorer-attach | 6 | 5 | 0 | 14 | 14 |\n\n  Line 435: | scorer-attach | 5 | converged | 1.00, 0.33, 0.40, 0.29, 0.00 | below |\n\n  Line 444: - scorer-attach, render-hooks-plugin and accuracy-runner: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability, then one pass over all four.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\": \"scorer-attach|^## 8|^### 8|^## 3|^### 3\\\\.1\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/review-report-pass-1.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570161659,"end":1794570162661}}