{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794570193087,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a23c4ffeXM7ei3r7kNeMRl","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4b806bd001MkWg14dyNPLrqr","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a23c4ffeXM7ei3r7kNeMRl","messageID":"msg_1d4b7f46e001TxgmdvKRE3bdMf","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9108a1ae353073e1","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach/ && sed -n '1,80p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"total 232\ndrwx------@ 19 michelkerkmeester  staff    608 Nov 13 07:44 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 10 michelkerkmeester  staff    320 Nov 13 12:40 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  9 michelkerkmeester  staff    288 Nov 13 07:40 .executor-state\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff     96 Nov 13 07:41 .legacy-projection-watermarks\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 michelkerkmeester  staff    128 Nov 13 07:44 containment\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:44 deep-review-audit-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  10900 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-config.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   8790 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-dashboard.md\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:44 deep-review-effect-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  27193 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-findings-registry.json\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  34570 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-state.jsonl\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  10217 Nov 13 07:44 deep-review-strategy.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:39 deltas\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff    430 Nov 13 07:08 invocation-metadata.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:39 iterations\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 michelkerkmeester  staff    128 Nov 13 07:28 locks-and-fencing-v1\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 michelkerkmeester  staff    128 Nov 13 07:44 logs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   9859 Nov 13 07:40 review-report.md\n---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking review progress, dimension coverage, findings, and outcomes across iterations for the scorer-attach fan-out lineage.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership markers. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those markers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (scorer-attach).\nScope: the 67 `scorer-attach` paths in `review/review-scope.txt` plus the 29 `shared` docs that\ndescribe them — the advisor's command-surfacing surface: `lib/command-attach.ts`, the generated\ncommand tables, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, the recommend/status handlers, the scorer modules\nthat gate command rows (`fusion.ts`, `ambiguity.ts`, `doctor-helper-handoff.ts`, `projection.ts`),\nthe schemas, the generated projection JSON, and their tests and docs.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The doctor command implementations and route manifest content (`doctor-install` lineage owns them);\n  this lineage reads them only as context evidence for the derived policy table.\n- The hook renderers and session readers (`render-hooks-plugin` lineage owns them); this lineage reads\n  `lib/render.ts` only to confirm how a surfaced `policy` reaches a reader.\n- The accuracy runner, holdout builder and command transcript scorer (`accuracy-runner` lineage owns\n  them); holdout hygiene here means proving this lineage's surface never reads or prints holdout rows.\n- The compiled-routing engine internals (`.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/**`); this lineage treats a\n  route decision as an input contract.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below `convergenceThreshold` 0.10 with no active P0/P1.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 5.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] security\n- [x] traceability\n- [x] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 7\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 232\ndrwx------@ 19 michelkerkmeester  staff    608 Nov 13 07:44 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 10 michelkerkmeester  staff    320 Nov 13 12:40 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@  9 michelkerkmeester  staff    288 Nov 13 07:40 .executor-state\ndrwxr-xr-x@  3 michelkerkmeester  staff     96 Nov 13 07:41 .legacy-projection-watermarks\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 michelkerkmeester  staff    128 Nov 13 07:44 containment\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:44 deep-review-audit-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  10900 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-config.json\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   8790 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-dashboard.md\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:44 deep-review-effect-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  27193 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-findings-registry.json\ndrwx------@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-ledger\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  34570 Nov 13 07:41 deep-review-state.jsonl\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff  10217 Nov 13 07:44 deep-review-strategy.md\ndrwxr-xr-x@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:39 deltas\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff    430 Nov 13 07:08 invocation-metadata.json\ndrwxr-xr-x@  7 michelkerkmeester  staff    224 Nov 13 07:39 iterations\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 michelkerkmeester  staff    128 Nov 13 07:28 locks-and-fencing-v1\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 michelkerkmeester  staff    128 Nov 13 07:44 logs\n-rw-r--r--@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff   9859 Nov 13 07:40 review-report.md\n---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking review progress, dimension coverage, findings, and outcomes across iterations for the scorer-attach fan-out lineage.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership markers. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those markers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (scorer-attach).\nScope: the 67 `scorer-attach` paths in `review/review-scope.txt` plus the 29 `shared` docs that\ndescribe them — the advisor's command-surfacing surface: `lib/command-attach.ts`, the generated\ncommand tables, `derive-command-bridges.cjs`, the recommend/status handlers, the scorer modules\nthat gate command rows (`fusion.ts`, `ambiguity.ts`, `doctor-helper-handoff.ts`, `projection.ts`),\nthe schemas, the generated projection JSON, and their tests and docs.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The doctor command implementations and route manifest content (`doctor-install` lineage owns them);\n  this lineage reads them only as context evidence for the derived policy table.\n- The hook renderers and session readers (`render-hooks-plugin` lineage owns them); this lineage reads\n  `lib/render.ts` only to confirm how a surfaced `policy` reaches a reader.\n- The accuracy runner, holdout builder and command transcript scorer (`accuracy-runner` lineage owns\n  them); holdout hygiene here means proving this lineage's surface never reads or prints holdout rows.\n- The compiled-routing engine internals (`.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/**`); this lineage treats a\n  route decision as an input contract.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below `convergenceThreshold` 0.10 with no active P0/P1.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 5.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] security\n- [x] traceability\n- [x] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 7\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"ls -la specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach/ && sed -n '1,80p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570192573,"end":1794570193087}}}}
