ommand-attach.ts and consumed at :329 and fusion.ts:677,:881\\\",\\n     affectedSurfaceHints:[\\\"hub command attachment\\\",\\\"scorer read-only lift\\\",\\\"hook briefs\\\"],\\n     claim:\\\"The gate withholds a command on \\\\\\\"do not change anything yet\\\\\\\" but not on the two common paraphrases of the same instruction.\\\",\\n     evidenceRefs:[\\\"command-attach.ts:289\\\",\\\"command-attach.ts:329\\\",\\\"fusion.ts:677\\\"],\\n     counterevidenceSought:\\\"pattern is byte-identical to base fusion.ts:675; every affected command is start or ask, so no silent write\\\",\\n     alternativeExplanation:\\\"the vocabulary is deliberately narrow to avoid withholding on a sentence that also asks for a change\\\",\\n     finalSeverity:\\\"P2\\\",confidence:\\\"high\\\",downgradeTrigger:\\\"withdraw if the pattern is widened elsewhere in this range\\\"},\\n    {id:\\\"SA2-P2-003\\\",severity:\\\"P2\\\",iteration:2,title:\\\"Privacy guard at advisor-status.vitest.ts:493 cannot fail because the fixture stores nothing private\\\",\\n     file:\\\"\\\\.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts:493\\\",findingClass:\\\"vacuous_privacy_assertion\\\",\\n     scopeProof:\\\"the test lives in runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts and its subject is reached from advisor-status.ts:487\\\",\\n     affectedSurfaceHints:[\\\"advisor_status output\\\",\\\"hook diagnostic read path\\\",\\\"holdout/privacy assurance\\\"],\\n     claim:\\\"The assertion does not exercise the path that could leak.\\\",\\n     evidenceRefs:[\\\"tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts:493-502\\\",\\\"handlers/advisor-status.ts:487-512\\\"],\\n     counterevidenceSought:\\\"neighbouring test :537-564 proves the writer strips errorDetails; what is uncovered is the read path echoing a record\\\",\\n     alternativeExplanation:\\\"the test may be a smoke check that the schema has no prompt-shaped field\\\",\\n     finalSeverity:\\\"P2\\\",confidence:\\\"medium\\\",downgradeTrigger:\\\"withdraw if a fixture persists a prompt-bearing record and asserts its absence\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  traceabilityChecks:{\\n    spec_code:{level:\\\"core\\\",status:\\\"partial\\\",notes:\\\"run policy means safe to start; no-edit wording narrower than intent (SA2-P2-002)\\\"},\\n    checklist_evidence:{level:\\\"core\\\",status:\\\"pending\\\",notes:\\\"no checklist claim in focus\\\"},\\n    feature_catalog_code:{level:\\\"overlay\\\",status:\\\"pending\\\",notes:\\\"scheduled for traceability iteration\\\"},\\n    skill_agent:{level:\\\"overlay\\\",status:\\\"pending\\\",notes:\\\"-\\\"},\\n    agent_cross_runtime:{level:\\\"overlay\\\",status:\\\"pending\\\",notes:\\\"-\\\"},\\n    playbook_capability:{level:\\\"overlay\\\",status:\\\"notApplicable\\\",notes:\\\"no playbook surface\\\"}\\n  },\\n  newFindingsRatio:1.0,\\n  noveltyJustification:\\\"Two new P2 findings against zero carried findings, so the weighted new-finding ratio is 1.00.\\\",\\n  sessionId:\\\"fanout-scorer-attach-2-1794570021136-noekp0\\\",generation:1,lineageMode:\\\"new\\\",\\n  timestamp:new Date().toISOString(),durationMs:660000\\n};\\nfs.writeFileSync(dir+\\\"/iterations/iter-002.event.json\\\",JSON.stringify(rec)+\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\nconsole.log(\\\"written\\\",rec.timestamp);\\n' && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2 --event-json specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2/iterations/iter-002.event.json | head -c 400; echo; echo \\\"EXIT:$?\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570880158,"end":1794570891637}}}}
