.\"\"\")\ns=re.sub(r\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->.*?<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\",\"\"\"<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: cross-cutting (all four)\n- Focus area: the `scorer-attach` files marked `no` that no iteration has opened yet — `lib/scorer/ambiguity.ts`, `doctor-helper-handoff.ts`, `projection.ts`, `scoring-constants.ts`, `lanes/*.ts`, `leaf-manifest.json`, the compiled-routing manifests, and the shared `ARCHITECTURE.md` / `runtime/lib/README.md`.\n- Reason: pass two's step (3) asks for new defects in the rest of the area.\n- Rotation status: all four configured dimensions complete (each PASS); one cross-cutting sweep left.\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: maintainability was productive (one latent P2); no blocked approach.\n- Required evidence: direct reads of the unopened files, plus the shared docs against the surfaces they describe.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\"\"\",s,flags=re.S)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"| `scripts/command-bridges/README.md` | traceability | 3 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\"\"\",\"\"\"| `scripts/command-bridges/README.md` | traceability | 3 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n| `handlers/advisor-recommend.ts` | correctness, maintainability | 4 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | complete |\n| `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts` | maintainability | 4 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | complete |\n| `scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs` | correctness, traceability, maintainability | 4 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 1 P2 | complete |\n| `lib/scorer/fusion.ts` | correctness, security | 2 | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | complete |\"\"\")\nopen(p,\"w\").write(s)\nprint(\"ok\")\nPY\nnode -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\");\nconst dir=\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2\";\nconst rec={\n  type:\"iteration\",iteration:4,mode:\"review\",target_agent:\"deep-review\",agent_definition_loaded:true,\n  resolved_route:\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\n  run:\"fanout-scorer-attach-2-