{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571431258,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4a23c4ffeXM7ei3r7kNeMRl","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4caab61001i1NAgjxBXLYwPY","sessionID":"ses_e2b4a23c4ffeXM7ei3r7kNeMRl","messageID":"msg_1d4ca9342001T1I4p46xmtRn79","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a28b87b51db2474","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Review Iteration 005\n\n## Dispatcher\n\n- Run: `fanout-scorer-attach-2-1794570021136-noekp0` (lineage `scorer-attach-2`, pass two, area `scorer-attach`)\n- Mode: review; executor: in-process (no nested dispatch)\n- Dimension: cross-cutting (correctness, security, traceability, maintainability)\n- Review focus addressed: pass two's step (3), \"look for new defects in the rest of your area\". This iteration opens the files marked `no` in `review-scope-2.txt` that no pass-two iteration had read, plus the two changed shared docs that describe this area.\n- Budget profile: `scan` (9-11 calls), used 8.\n\n## Files Reviewed\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/leaf-manifest.json:1-127` (whole file)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/leaf-aliases.json:1-582` (whole file)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/README.md:1-203` (whole file, changed shared doc)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md:126` (changed shared doc, the command-row paragraph)\n- `.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/{sk-design,sk-doc,system-deep-loop}/manifest.json` (shape and policy keys)\n- Executed: leaf/alias consistency (116 leaves, 116 aliases, 0 missing on disk, 0 orphan aliases); existence check for every file named in the `runtime/lib` README's tree and key-file table.\n\n## Findings - New\n\n### P0 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n### P2 Findings\n\nNone.\n\n## Verification Performed\n\n- **Leaf registry.** `leaf-manifest.json` lists 116 leaves; every path exists on disk in this checkout. `leaf-aliases.json` carries exactly 116 entries, one per manifest leaf, with no orphan alias and no leaf missing its alias. Nothing this lineage reviewed is registered under a path that no longer exists.\n- **Compiled-routing activation manifests.** The three hub manifests in this area share one shape (`schemaVersion: V1`, `selectedPolicy`, `servingAuthority`, `shadowOnly`) and carry no divergent hub-specific key, which is what the attach path expects when it treats a route as an input contract.\n- **Library map.** Every top-level module and every subfolder named in `runtime/lib/README.md` sections 4 and 5 exists. The `command-attach.ts` row at `:132` matches the module: no imports, `MODE_COMMANDS` generated from each hub's `mode-registry.json`, the deep-loop gate on typed command or `DEPTH_WORDING`, and the `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` gate.\n- **Architecture paragraph.** `ARCHITECTURE.md:126` matches `fusion.ts:847-848`, `:881` and `:917-918` on the two bars (0.72 cosine, 0.02 lead), the no-edit rule and the read-only-only rule.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n\n- `spec_code` — partial (unchanged; no new spec claim was read).\n- `checklist_evidence` — pending. No packet checklist claim was in focus.\n- `feature_catalog_code` — partial (unchanged from iteration 3; the changed feature doc matches the code).\n- `skill_agent` — notApplicable for this surface (no agent definition is routed by command attachment).\n- `agent_cross_runtime` — partial. The attach contract is runtime-agnostic (no runtime branch in `command-attach.ts` or `derive-command-bridges.cjs`); cross-runtime behaviour was exercised in pass one and is not re-scored here.\n- `playbook_capability` — notApplicable.\n\n## Integration Evidence\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/leaf-manifest.json` and `leaf-aliases.json` are the two surfaces `skill-graph-query` resolves a leaf through; both agree with the tree, so the `command-meaning-matching.md` leaf added in this range is reachable by id and by path.\n- `.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/sk-doc/manifest.json` is the policy input the attach path treats as authoritative for `sk-doc`; its four keys match the other two hub manifests, so no hub is activated on a different policy shape.\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- **Pre-existing library-map gap.** `runtime/lib/README.md` section 3 lists 13 folders and section 4 lists 5; `lib/skill-graph/` appears in neither, although it exists (with its own README) in both the base commit and HEAD. Recorded, not reported: the gap predates this range, the folder documents itself, and the omission is not about the command-surfacing change pass two was asked to review.\n- **`private-skill-target.ts` unlisted.** The same section-4 tree omits two top-level modules that exist (`compiled-routing-flag.ts`, `private-skill-target.ts`); same provenance and same disposition as above.\n- **Shared-doc ownership.** `runtime/lib/README.md` and `ARCHITECTURE.md` are `shared` in the scope file, so they were checked only for statements about this lineage's files, per the non-goals.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n\n- `leaf-manifest.json` / `leaf-aliases.json` — 116/116 exact agreement, every target present.\n- `runtime/lib/README.md:126-145` — the key-file table's statements about this area's modules are accurate.\n- `ARCHITECTURE.md:126` — the command-row meaning pass paragraph is accurate.\n- The three activation manifests — one shape, four keys, no divergence.\n\n## Ruled Out\n\n- **A leaf registered at a path that does not exist.** Ruled out by existence check over all 116.\n- **An alias pointing at a non-leaf or a leaf with no alias.** Ruled out by set comparison both ways.\n- **A hub activated on a different manifest shape.** Ruled out by key comparison across the three manifests.\n- **Doc drift between `ARCHITECTURE.md` and the meaning-pass constants.** Ruled out against `fusion.ts:847-848`, `:881`, `:917-918`.\n\n## Next Focus\n\n- Dimension: none remaining\n- Focus area: synthesis; the lineage report is `review-report.md` in this directory\n- Reason: four dimensions plus a cross-cutting sweep are covered, this iteration produced no new finding, and `newFindingsRatio` is 0.00 against the 0.10 threshold\n- Rotation status: complete\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: no blocked approach; correctness and traceability were the productive dimensions\n- Required evidence: the five iteration records, the registry, and the strategy's running counts\n\nReview verdict: PASS\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2/iterations/iteration-005.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2/iterations/iteration-005.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2/iterations/iteration-005.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"# Review Iteration 005\\n\\n## Dispatcher\\n\\n- Run: `fanout-scorer-attach-2-1794570021136-noekp0` (lineage `scorer-attach-2`, pass two, area `scorer-attach`)\\n- Mode: review; executor: in-process (no nested dispatch)\\n- Dimension: cross-cutting (correctness, security, traceability, maintainability)\\n- Review focus addressed: pass two's step (3), \\\"look for new defects in the rest of your area\\\". This iteration opens the files marked `no` in `review-scope-2.txt` that no pass-two iteration had read, plus the two changed shared docs that describe this area.\\n- Budget profile: `scan` (9-11 calls), used 8.\\n\\n## Files Reviewed\\n\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/leaf-manifest.json:1-127` (whole file)\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/leaf-aliases.json:1-582` (whole file)\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/README.md:1-203` (whole file, changed shared doc)\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/ARCHITECTURE.md:126` (changed shared doc, the command-row paragraph)\\n- `.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/{sk-design,sk-doc,system-deep-loop}/manifest.json` (shape and policy keys)\\n- Executed: leaf/alias consistency (116 leaves, 116 aliases, 0 missing on disk, 0 orphan aliases); existence check for every file named in the `runtime/lib` README's tree and key-file table.\\n\\n## Findings - New\\n\\n### P0 Findings\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n### P1 Findings\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n### P2 Findings\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n## Verification Performed\\n\\n- **Leaf registry.** `leaf-manifest.json` lists 116 leaves; every path exists on disk in this checkout. `leaf-aliases.json` carries exactly 116 entries, one per manifest leaf, with no orphan alias and no leaf missing its alias. Nothing this lineage reviewed is registered under a path that no longer exists.\\n- **Compiled-routing activation manifests.** The three hub manifests in this area share one shape (`schemaVersion: V1`, `selectedPolicy`, `servingAuthority`, `shadowOnly`) and carry no divergent hub-specific key, which is what the attach path expects when it treats a route as an input contract.\\n- **Library map.** Every top-level module and every subfolder named in `runtime/lib/README.md` sections 4 and 5 exists. The `command-attach.ts` row at `:132` matches the module: no imports, `MODE_COMMANDS` generated from each hub's `mode-registry.json`, the deep-loop gate on typed command or `DEPTH_WORDING`, and the `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` gate.\\n- **Architecture paragraph.** `ARCHITECTURE.md:126` matches `fusion.ts:847-848`, `:881` and `:917-918` on the two bars (0.72 cosine, 0.02 lead), the no-edit rule and the read-only-only rule.\\n\\n## Traceability Checks\\n\\n- `spec_code` — partial (unchanged; no new spec claim was read).\\n- `checklist_evidence` — pending. No packet checklist claim was in focus.\\n- `feature_catalog_code` — partial (unchanged from iteration 3; the changed feature doc matches the code).\\n- `skill_agent` — notApplicable for this surface (no agent definition is routed by command attachment).\\n- `agent_cross_runtime` — partial. The attach contract is runtime-agnostic (no runtime branch in `command-attach.ts` or `derive-command-bridges.cjs`); cross-runtime behaviour was exercised in pass one and is not re-scored here.\\n- `playbook_capability` — notApplicable.\\n\\n## Integration Evidence\\n\\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/leaf-manifest.json` and `leaf-aliases.json` are the two surfaces `skill-graph-query` resolves a leaf through; both agree with the tree, so the `command-meaning-matching.md` leaf added in this range is reachable by id and by path.\\n- `.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/sk-doc/manifest.json` is the policy input the attach path treats as authoritative for `sk-doc`; its four keys match the other two hub manifests, so no hub is activated on a different policy shape.\\n\\n## Edge Cases\\n\\n- **Pre-existing library-map gap.** `runtime/lib/README.md` section 3 lists 13 folders and section 4 lists 5; `lib/skill-graph/` appears in neither, although it exists (with its own README) in both the base commit and HEAD. Recorded, not reported: the gap predates this range, the folder documents itself, and the omission is not about the command-surfacing change pass two was asked to review.\\n- **`private-skill-target.ts` unlisted.** The same section-4 tree omits two top-level modules that exist (`compiled-routing-flag.ts`, `private-skill-target.ts`); same provenance and same disposition as above.\\n- **Shared-doc ownership.** `runtime/lib/README.md` and `ARCHITECTURE.md` are `shared` in the scope file, so they were checked only for statements about this lineage's files, per the non-goals.\\n\\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\\n\\n- `leaf-manifest.json` / `leaf-aliases.json` — 116/116 exact agreement, every target present.\\n- `runtime/lib/README.md:126-145` — the key-file table's statements about this area's modules are accurate.\\n- `ARCHITECTURE.md:126` — the command-row meaning pass paragraph is accurate.\\n- The three activation manifests — one shape, four keys, no divergence.\\n\\n## Ruled Out\\n\\n- **A leaf registered at a path that does not exist.** Ruled out by existence check over all 116.\\n- **An alias pointing at a non-leaf or a leaf with no alias.** Ruled out by set comparison both ways.\\n- **A hub activated on a different manifest shape.** Ruled out by key comparison across the three manifests.\\n- **Doc drift between `ARCHITECTURE.md` and the meaning-pass constants.** Ruled out against `fusion.ts:847-848`, `:881`, `:917-918`.\\n\\n## Next Focus\\n\\n- Dimension: none remaining\\n- Focus area: synthesis; the lineage report is `review-report.md` in this directory\\n- Reason: four dimensions plus a cross-cutting sweep are covered, this iteration produced no new finding, and `newFindingsRatio` is 0.00 against the 0.10 threshold\\n- Rotation status: complete\\n- Blocked/productive carry-forward: no blocked approach; correctness and traceability were the productive dimensions\\n- Required evidence: the five iteration records, the registry, and the strategy's running counts\\n\\nReview verdict: PASS\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2/iterations/iteration-005.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571414369,"end":1794571431258}}}}
